{"id":"ioib4lu14dqplp9tvn5k1c04y","title":"OpenAI、Google、Microsoft、Anthropic 联合支持新内容刮擦退出标准","originalTitle":"The biggest names in AI are backing a new way to opt out of scraping","summary":"OpenAI、Google、Microsoft、Anthropic 联合宣布支持新内容刮擦退出标准，允许出版商统一设置AI训练权限。该标准由Anthropic技术负责人Kevin Kelley主导制定，通过网站robots.txt文件实现控制，微软将提供更细粒度的AI训练和知识锚定（AI grounding）退出选项。目前出版商需向各AI公司单独申请权限，新标准将简化流程。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"The Verge · AI"},"links":{"original":"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1023763/openai-google-microsoft-ai-scraping-standard-opt-out"},"publishedAt":"2026-10-30T20:26:10.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-10-30T21:22:31.043Z","timelineAt":"2026-10-30T21:22:31.043Z","category":"industry","tags":["行业动态","OpenAI","Google","Microsoft","Anthropic"],"score":55,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Emma Roth","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"openai","name":"OpenAI / ChatGPT"},{"slug":"anthropic","name":"Anthropic / Claude"},{"slug":"google","name":"Google / Gemini"},{"slug":"microsoft","name":"Microsoft / Copilot"},{"slug":"industry","name":"行业动态"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}